:: Mansion Intro Orphanage
<<effects>>

"Sorry to trouble you," says Avery. <<person1>><<He>> glances at the orphans peeking around the reception door. "Can we have a word in private?"
<br><br>
Bailey doesn't wear <<person2>><<his>> best smile. "Of course. Come in." <<He>> turns towards <<his>> office. Avery follows, making a detour to grasp your arm. <<person1>><<He>> pulls you after <<him>>.
<br><br>

<<link [[Protest|Mansion Intro Orphanage Protest]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Go quietly|Mansion Intro Orphanage Quiet]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Intro Orphanage Protest
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if $speech_attitude_avery>>
	<<set _speechAttitudeResolved to "meek">>
<</if>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"Do you have to tug me so hard?" you ask, trying not to stumble after Avery.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"A little warning would be appreciated," you say, smoothing your voice before it can shake.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I'll come," you say, following where Avery pulls. "You don't need to drag me."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Could you ask before dragging me somewhere?" you say.
<<else>>
	"It's rude to barge in and yank me around like this," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"Not now," Avery says, unbothered and undeterred by your words. "Just be quiet."
<br><br>

<<person1>><<He>> closes the office door behind <<him>>, while Bailey takes a seat at <<person2>><<his>> desk. Avery looks around for another chair, but there's none to be found.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Mansion Intro Orphanage 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Intro Orphanage Quiet
<<effects>>

You remain silent while Avery closes the office door, and Bailey takes a seat at <<person2>><<his>> desk. Avery looks around for another chair, but there's none to be found.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Mansion Intro Orphanage 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Intro Orphanage 2
<<effects>>

"I know why you're here," Bailey says, running a hand through <<person2>><<his>> hair. "You want custody of this one."
<br>
"Correct," Avery says. "I'm suitable. A member of the community in good standing."
<br>
"It takes more than that to adopt one of mine."
<br>
"Of course. I'm sure there are background checks." Avery smiles. "But that's not the only reason I'm here. I'd also like to make a donation. To support the good work you do."
<br>
Bailey looks unimpressed. Avery retrieves a slip of paper from <<person1>><<his>> pocket, and slides it across the desk. It's blank, on this side. Bailey lifts a corner. <<person2>><<He>> peeks beneath.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Mansion Intro Orphanage 3]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Mansion Intro Orphanage 3
<<effects>>

Whatever <<person2>><<he>> sees, Bailey considers the slip of paper for a good while. The room is silent, except the tick of a clock, and the occasional thump from someone trying to eavesdrop outside.
<br><br>
<span class="red">"Done."</span> Bailey pokes the slip into <<his>> pocket, and reaches across the desk. Avery takes <<his>> hand, and they shake. Bailey looks at you. "You're under Avery's protection now. <span class="red"><<person1>><<He>>'ll cover your debt.</span>"
<br><br>

<<link [[Ask how much you cost|Mansion Intro Orphanage Cost]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Thank Avery|Mansion Intro Orphanage Avery]]>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
<br>
<<link [[Thank Bailey|Mansion Intro Orphanage Bailey]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Remain silent|Mansion Intro Orphanage Silent]]>><</link>>
<br>



:: Mansion Intro Orphanage Cost
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if $speech_attitude_avery>>
	<<set _speechAttitudeResolved to "meek">>
<</if>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I hope I didn't cost too much," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"May I ask what was agreed?" you say, glancing between Bailey and Avery. "It feels strange not to know."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I don't need to know," you say, then fail to keep your eyes off the paper. "Unless you want to tell me."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"How much was enough?" you ask Bailey. "I'd rather hear the number than be left guessing."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"I hope you got a good price," you say, looking at Bailey.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"Did you haggle over me, or did you sell cheap?" you ask Bailey.
<<else>>
	"How much did you get for me?" you ask Bailey.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"You've a quick mouth," Avery says. "It's not about the money."
<br>
"We're done here," interrupts Bailey.
<br>
Avery takes your hand, and smiles at Bailey. "Can I invite you over for a drink?"
<br>
"I'm busy," Bailey replies, rising to <<person2>><<his>> feet.
<br>
"<<if Time.weekDay is 7>>Tomorrow<<elseif Time.weekDay is 1>>Next Sunday<<else>>This Sunday<</if>> then. I'm throwing a party. It would be good for both of us to be seen together."
<br>
"Fine." Bailey opens the office door. A gaggle of orphans disperse.
<br><br>

<<link [[Ask if you can say goodbye to the other residents|Mansion Intro Orphanage Goodbye]]>><<hope 1>><</link>><<ghope>>
<br>
<<link [[Remain silent|Mansion Intro Orphanage Silent 2]]>><</link>>
<br>


