:: Mansion Intro Orphanage Goodbye
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if $speech_attitude_avery>>
	<<set _speechAttitudeResolved to "meek">>
<</if>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"Will you let me say goodbye to my friends?" you ask.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"May I say goodbye to the others first?" you ask. "It won't take long."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Only if it's allowed," you say. "But I'd like to say goodbye."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I'm saying goodbye before we go," you say, looking towards the door.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Give me a moment to say goodbye to my friends," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"I should say goodbye," you say. "Some of them might like to know I escaped."
<<else>>
	"Can I say goodbye to my friends?" you ask.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Avery frowns in confusion for a moment, then glances at the orphans. "Best you no longer associate with those people."
<br><br>

<<person1>><<He>> pulls you through the orphanage doors, and towards <<his>> waiting car.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Mansion Intro]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
